## 2. Cross-sectional Forecasting Performance

- **IC (test)**:
  - mean = 0.0662, std = 0.1368, ICIR = 0.48, HAC t-stat = 7.9 (lags=5)
- **RankIC (test)**:
  - mean = 0.0796, std = 0.1327, IR = 0.60, HAC t-stat = 10.1 (lags=5)
- 注：采用 Newey–West(HAC) t-stat 以处理日度序列的自相关/异方差。

