- 2021-02-09: diag_mass=0.006, top5_mass=0.045, entropy=0.997
- 2021-09-28: diag_mass=0.006, top5_mass=0.045, entropy=0.997
- 2022-12-30: diag_mass=0.006, top5_mass=0.047, entropy=0.996

